# 🍷 ÉLAN — An Evening Worth Remembering

A beautiful and elegant restaurant menu website created as an HTML & CSS project for Codédex.

## ✨ About the Project

**ÉLAN** is a fictional contemporary fine-dining restaurant designed around an intimate, luxurious dining experience.

The website features an elegant restaurant atmosphere, curated menu items, and an interactive order form.

## 🌹 Features

* Elegant restaurant hero section
* Restaurant name and tagline
* Navigation to menu and order sections
* Beautiful food menu cards
* Menu item descriptions and prices
* Quantity selection for each dish
* Add-on options using checkboxes
* Dining preference using radio buttons
* Special requests textarea
* "Go To Checkout" button
* Responsive design for different screen sizes
* Hover effects and smooth scrolling

