## 🎨 Design

The website uses a warm, elegant color palette inspired by luxury dining:

* Cream
* Espresso brown
* Dusty rose
* Champagne-inspired accents

The design focuses on creating a romantic and sophisticated restaurant atmosphere while keeping the interface simple and easy to navigate.

## 📱 Responsive Design

The website is designed to adapt to:

* 💻 Desktop screens
* 📱 Mobile devices
* 📲 Tablet screens

